<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26359" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Leucippē</span></b> , ēs,
			f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λευκίππη</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>The daughter of Thestor</i>, <i><span class="en">Hyg. Fab.
				190</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>The wife of Ilus, and mother of Laomedon</i>, <i><span class="en">Hyg. Fab.
				250</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>The wife of Thestius</i>, <i><span class="en">Hyg. Fab.
				14</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>A Roman surname</i>: AVRELIA LEVCIPPE, Inscr. ap.
			Grut. 761, 7.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
